%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: GoodMoniRW
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ({mc} seemed a little... upset.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (You think that the pressure's getting to him, or something?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678508
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: The pressure?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Yeah, like, the pressure of being this "dragonborn" or whatever.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Maybe? I feel like it'd be more likely he's feeling homesick.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Ha, I didn't even really think of that...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678509
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (If you'd believe it, I'm not in any hurry to go home.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678510
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Get out of here and get to you? Sure.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678511
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (But going back "home?")
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678512
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I'm not entirely sure what we'd even be going back to...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678513
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Honestly, for as much as it sucks not being able to manipulate this
      place like back home...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678516
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (It's sort of been nice just being a regular girl again.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678514
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Even if this "regular girl" has gone through more life-and-death situations
      in two days than most have in their lifetime, ahaha...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678515
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678517
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (... do you think {mc}'s mood will improve when we link up with Sayo-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678518
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (The other girls. When we link up with the other girls.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678519
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Actually, at the start of the day, {mc} thought to himself that he was
      happy to have... sent them away to work with the factions.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Really?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678520
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: He was worried about being responsible for a whole group of people.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678521
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Well, I guess the club president is gonna have to step up her game,
      then!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678522
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (See you tomorrow, babe.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678523
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Good night, Monika.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678524
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
